  "goodToKnow": "Die Föderation is a federation: die Russische Föderation. Germany is a federal state (Bundesstaat) of 16 Länder, and der Föderalismus is a core principle of the Grundgesetz, protected by the eternity clause (Ewigkeitsklausel). Education, police and culture are mainly Länder matters, so school systems differ from state to state, a constant source of debate. From Latin foedus (treaty). Plural: die Föderationen."
